- `benchmarks/w44_144_terminal_d4_dump_2026-05-21.tsv` — 142 rows
  per-strategy summary across 5 efforts × 2 encoders + 5-row agreement
  summary at bottom
- `benchmarks/w44_144_terminal_d4_dump_2026-05-21.analysis.txt` —
  human-readable per-strategy + per-region qac table for all 5 efforts
- `benchmarks/w44_144_terminal_d4_dump_2026-05-21.dumps.txt` — dump
  runner stdout (bytes per cell, dump TSV sizes)
