  encoders in subprocesses with W44-76 dump infrastructure)
- `benchmarks/w44_144_analyze.py` — Python analyzer (per-strategy,
  per-region, agreement, top-disagreement)

## Reproducer

```bash
# Build cjxl-rs at current main:
CARGO_TARGET_DIR=$HOME/work/zen/jxl-encoder-shared-target \
  cargo build --release -p jxl-encoder-cli

# Re-run dump methodology:
bash benchmarks/w44_144_run_dumps.sh

# Re-analyze (writes TSV to stdout):
python3 benchmarks/w44_144_analyze.py
```

